<font size=3 color=#606060><strong>▽</strong> 2006/09/29 (金) 18:25:21 <strong>▽</strong> <a href="mailto:mst_kg@infoseek.jp">天爛</a> </font></td>
<td nowrap align=right><font size=3>　<a href="bbs.cgi?res=200609295182521&log=shining_heaven">返信</a>　削除<input type=checkbox name="target" value="200609295182521"></font>
